# WIP panel version comparison

Companion to "Panel Templates — Referencable Design-System Examples". That plan's screenshots are single images, so comments can't land inside a panel. Here every panel is broken into its regions and rows — **each line below is its own comment anchor**. Select the exact line (a row, a filter, a group header, a delta) and comment on it directly. When commenting on the shared anatomy, name the version (develop / PR 496 / nod-978) your comment targets.

Two decisions live in this doc:

- **Decision 1 — Content Explorer (owner: Katie):** which version goes into the browser.
- **Decision 2 — Updated Dashboard (owner: Aaron + Katie):** which board version is production-bound.

---

