**Decision 1 (Katie): which Content Explorer goes into the browser? Comment on this line to record the call.**

Research note: branch `katie/nod-978-ccore-content-overview-explorer` appears superseded — PR 242 was closed and the work merged (evolved) via PR 244. The merged panel on `develop` is what renders today. The stale branch is included below because it made different UI choices worth reconciling before the design-system example is locked.

