## 2. Updated Dashboard (Updates Dashboard board)

**Decision 2 (Aaron + Katie): which board version is production-bound? Comment on this line to record the call.**

Research note: `katie/nod-1051-space-dashboard` (PR 270) merged as Settings → Spaces — a different surface, out of this contest. The live candidates are the board as merged to `develop` and PR 496 (`claude/updates-dashboard-board-surface`, NOD-1254). Both render the same fixture content; the contest is in theme behavior, filter wiring, and provenance rules.

### Board anatomy — shared by both versions, from the `/updates-dashboard-demo` fixtures

Header region:

- Board title: `Updates Dashboard`
- Refresh control (top right)

Left rail — search and filters:

- Search input, placeholder: `Search projects...`
- Relatedness toggle: `Direct only` | `Expanded` (Expanded active in fixtures)
- Filter by spaces: `Nodaste Studio` (checked)
- Filter by spaces: `ccore/heddle` (checked)
- Filter by spaces: `Private` (checked)
- Filter by spaces: `Tinker Lab` (checked)
- Filter by spaces: `ccore/archive` — disabled, flagged `unreachable`
- Last updated preset: `Updated since any date`
- Due preset: `Due any time`
- Assignee preset: `Assigned to anyone`
- Type checkboxes: `Signals`, `Tasks`, `Decisions`, `Clarifications` (checked), `Reference` (unchecked)

Main column header:

