- Row: `Adopt green-400 for dark --weft-ok` · `Decision awaiting approval` · `Weft Tokens` · `Nodaste Studio` · `decision`
- Row: `Dark board contrast on ok/stop greens` · `Open · raised 2d ago` · `Heddle UI` · `Nodaste Studio` · `signal`
- Row: `Which greens read as "ok" vs "stop"?` · `Clarification needs an answer` · `Heddle UI` · `Nodaste Studio` · `clarification`

FYI group (`worth knowing · no action needed`, count 3):

